 a telephone</text><text start="824.079" dur="5.041">and Bernie was a little down and by the</text><text start="826.48" dur="4.24">end of that night he was way up. And the</text><text start="829.12" dur="4.24">same thing is happening with John. When</text><text start="830.72" dur="4.799">I see it, it&amp;#39;s amazing. It&amp;#39;s a really an</text><text start="833.36" dur="3.52">amazing story and I&amp;#39;m very proud of you</text><text start="835.519" dur="3.76">because you&amp;#39;ve been he&amp;#39;s gone to</text><text start="836.88" dur="4.399">Washington and in a short period of time</text><text start="839.279" dur="3.68">he&amp;#39;s become one of the most Bernie right</text><text start="841.279" dur="5.041">he&amp;#39;s become one of the most respected</text><text start="842.959" dur="6.32">senators down there and uh the two of</text><text start="846.32" dur="5.12">them really the two of them Ohio</text><text start="849.279" dur="6.321">produces good people that&amp;#39;s what it&amp;#39;s</text><text start="851.44" dur="7.6">all about produce good people</text><text start="855.6" dur="5.599">but there there are only six days left</text><text start="859.04" dur="4.72">until election day so every single</text><text start="861.199" dur="4.561">person in this arena and all the people</text><text start="863.76" dur="3.519">thousands of people outside that I&amp;#39;ve</text><text start="865.76" dur="4.079">never seen. You know, you rarely see</text><text start="867.279" dur="6.721">where you have almost from airport to</text><text start="869.839" dur="7.401">the fake news on they they said</text><text start="874" dur="3.24">thank you.</text><text start="879.12" dur="4.32">Thank you.</text><text start="881.839" dur="3.041">But if you can get out to vote, we&amp;#39;re</text><text start="883.44" dur="3.12">going to have a tremendous we&amp;#39;re going</text><text start="884.88" dur="4.639">to have a tremendous victory. Early</text><text start="886.56" dur="5.9