 start="4149.6" dur="4">And just yesterday, she found that</text><text start="4151.6" dur="4.719">funny. This one, who&amp;#39;s that woman with</text><text start="4153.6" dur="5.759">that hearty laugh? Look at her. Somebody</text><text start="4156.319" dur="4.721">found that very funny. Where is she? Oh,</text><text start="4159.359" dur="3.761">look at her. She&amp;#39;s a young, beautiful</text><text start="4161.04" dur="4.48">woman. I&amp;#39;m not allowed to say beautiful</text><text start="4163.12" dur="4.8">as a politician. I will never I refuse</text><text start="4165.52" dur="5.36">to call you beautiful, but you have a</text><text start="4167.92" dur="6.16">very hearty laugh. And just yesterday, I</text><text start="4170.88" dur="6.24">announced that we are terminating sleepy</text><text start="4174.08" dur="6.159">Joe Biden&amp;#39;s burdensome and unnecessary</text><text start="4177.12" dur="6">methane rule targeting small oil and gas</text><text start="4180.239" dur="6.801">producers, which will save consumers AND</text><text start="4183.12" dur="6.4">ENERGY PRODUCERS $45 BILLION IN cost</text><text start="4187.04" dur="4.96">unlike</text><text start="4189.52" dur="4.4">unlike what nobody&amp;#39;s ever done this kind</text><text start="4192" dur="4.719">of stuff. We&amp;#39;re going to unlock vast</text><text start="4193.92" dur="4.319">quantities of Ohio energy and unleash</text><text start="4196.719" dur="3.361">210</text><text start="4198.239" dur="3.521">million barrels at a minimum because of</text><text start="4200.08" dur="4.88">what we&amp;#39;ve done. But don&amp;#39;t even think</text><text start="4201.76" dur="5.36">about that. When the war ends, the price</text><text start="4204.96" dur="5.4">of gasoline and the price of oil is</text><text start="4207.12" dur="3.24">going to go.</text><text start="4211.28" dur="4.8">AND WHEN YOU REELECT JOHN HOUSTON, ONE</text><text start="4213.36" dur="6.48">OF THE BEST, one of the most respected</text><text start="4216.08" dur="6.56">senators in Washington, John Houston, I</text><text start="4219.84" dur="5.359">will sign John&amp;#39;s rateayer protection act</text><text start="4222.64" dur="5.44">to lower utility costs for the consumer</text><text start="4225.199" dur="5.601">by ensuring that big tech companies pay</text><text start="4228.08" dur="5.72">the cost of their own electricity</text><text start="4230.8" dur="3">production.</text><text start="4245.84" dur="4.56">Thank you, Phil. Starting on day one of</text><text start="4248.08" dur="3.84">my administration, we abolished all</text><text start="4250.4" dur="3.52">discriminatory,</text><text start="4251.92" dur="3.44">diversity, equity, and inclusion</text><text start="4253.92" dur="3.52">policies throughout the federal</text><text start="4255.36" dur="4">government.</text><text start="4257.44" dur="4.719">We got critical race theory and</text><text start="4259.36" dur="5.839">transgender insanity out of our schools.</text><text start="4262.159" dur="6.681">We made English the official language of</text><text start="4265.199" dur="3.641">the United States.</text><text start="4274.64" dur="5.76">And our country is doing so well, making</text><text start="4277.36" dur="5.12">so much. But it&amp;#39;s doing so well under</text><text start="4280.4" dur="4.96">Republican leadership that only I can</text><text start="4282.48" dur="5.12">make this promise to you. If Republicans</text><text start="4285.36" dur="5.04">win the House of Representatives and the</text><text start="4287.6" dur="8.04">Senate, I am going to give all adult</text><text start="4290.4" dur="5.24">citizens in the United States $5,000.</text><text start="4314" dur="4.719">And only Republicans can do it because</text><text start="4316.56" dur="4.48">we&amp;#39;re taking in massive amounts of money</text><text start="4318.719" dur="4.96">through tariffs and record setting</text><text start="4321.04" dur="5.119">economic success. But the Democrat</text><text start="4323.679" dur="4.56">policies won&amp;#39;t allow this to happen. In</text><text start="4326.159" dur="5.361">fact, the opposite. If the Democrats</text><text start="4328.239" dur="6.401">win, their policies are just as crazy as</text><text start="4331.52" dur="5.76">open borders and men playing in women&amp;#39;s</text><text start="4334.64" dur="5.44">sports and transgender for everybody.</text><text start="4337.28" dur="6.64">They&amp;#39;re just as crazy. you will have a</text><text start="4340.08" dur="6.079">1929 style economic depression. And I</text><text start="4343.92" dur="4.88">only hope that&amp;#39;s not so. But if you want</text><text start="4346.159" dur="4.801">to make it not so, don&amp;#39;t vote for them.</text><text start="4348.8" dur="4.879">If the Republicans win, you&amp;#39;ll each have</text><text start="4350.96" dur="5.12">$5,000 in your pocket and economic</text><text start="4353.679" dur="6.121">success for our country like we have</text><text start="4356.08" dur="3.72">never seen before.</text><text start="4361.679" dur="7.321">And remember, just recently I gave all</text><text start="4364.32" dur="4.68">members of the military $1,776.</text><text start="4372.88" dur="5.12">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; And everyone said that it couldn&amp;#39;t be</text><text start="4374.56" dur="7.04">done, but I did it.</text><text start="4378" dur="6.719">It was actually 1,775.</text><text start="4381.6" dur="5.76">And I said, $1 more, you have 1776. And</text><text start="4384.719" dur="4.081">we did it. And the military is very</text><text start="4387.36" dur="4.08">happy about it. It was less than a year</text><text start="4388.8" dur="5.52">ago. The $5,000, call it a Trump</text><text start="4391.44" dur="5.36">dividend, is approximately1 trillion</text><text start="4394.32" dur="6.24">dollars in cost. But we have a record</text><text start="4396.8" dur="8.399">setting $22.2 trillion pouring into our</text><text start="4400.56" dur="7.92">coun